\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2  Ringgit Higher Late Vs Dlr On Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 1998\par 09:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (Dow Jones)--The Malaysian ringgit edged higher against the U.S. dollar late Friday on the back of intermittent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Bank Negara, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was periodically selling dollars to stablize the ringgit, which has lost over 15% of its value against the dollar in the last week alone. \par \par \uc2  'Bank Negara doesn't want the ringgit to touch MR4.8000 to the dollar,' one Singapore-based dealer said. The ringgit hit a historic low of MYR4.8800 against the dollar Wednesday, raising questions about how much longer Malaysia can stave off a recession. \par \par \uc2  At 0838 GMT (4:38 a.m. EST), the dollar is at MYR4.6250 compared with MYR4.6800 late Thursday. The dollar traded between MYR4.6000 and MYR4.7739 Friday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have been expensive. Dealers said there was strong corporate demand for dollars as anticipation of further \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciations put more downward pressure on the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  Ringgit traders were also keeping a close eye on developments in Indonesia. A high-level team from the International Monetary Fund including managing director Michel Camdessus will arrive in Jakarta next week, as will U.S. Deputy Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers and Defense Secretary William Cohen. \par \par \uc2  Reports that President Suharto had pledged to meet the demands of his country's IMF program to U.S. President Bill Clinton helped lift the rupiah, and also boosted sentiment on the ringgit later in the day. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 09-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0859GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 1851 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du19007a4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
