\par\par \b \uc2  Ringgit slips vs dollar despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR, Jan 8 (Reuters) - The ringgit slipped against the dollar in late trading on Thursday, with thin liquidity continuing to exaggerate moves, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Talk that \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly to defend the ringgit failed to halt the slide as the dollar remained well bid. \par \par \uc2  At 1000 GMT, the ringgit was at 4.7100/7200 to the dollar, against around 4.5400 late on Wednesday. It had fallen to as low as 4.8800 a dollar on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "There has been persistent demand for dollars and only offers by Bank Negara were capping its rise,' said a dealer with a Malaysian bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the morning, selling small amounts of dollars from 4.70 to 4.60 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, Bank Negara sold dollars from 4.80 to 4.60 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  The size of Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not known, but dealers said it need not have been big to move rates due to the thin market liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Anwar Ibrahim on Wednesday confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets "to ensure stable market conditions to allow for the efficient functioning of the market." \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad said Malaysia had no immediate plans to impose controls on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealings as this would cause a loss of confidence. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said weakness in the Indonesian rupiah was expected to drag the ringgit lower. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah hit the 10,000 to the dollar support level in late afternoon Asian trading. \par \par \uc2  -- Kuala Lumpur Newsroom (603)201 4813; Fax (603)232 6752 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: kuala.lumpur.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926du18019n6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
