\par\par \b \uc2  INSTANT VIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2  says Bank Negara  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR, Jan 7 (Reuters) - Malaysian Finance Minister Anwar Ibrahim said on Wednesday \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Negara had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  Following is a selection of reactions from analysts: \par \par \uc2  SIMON FLINT, senior emerging markets economist at I.D.E.A. \par \par \uc2  "It was a fairly boring statement. It's mildly positive as they are maintaining some belief in the strength of the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  "It's good they have reiterated the flexible exchange rate policy, but in terms of boosting economic resilience, they have not introduced specific measures to defend the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  "The impact other than sharp increase in interest rates, it will have a very mild impact on the ringgit because it does not contain any concrete measures. \par \par \uc2  "Already there has been some consolidation on the ringgit, so people may use this opportunity to get onboard dollar again. I don't think it is unreasonable for it to go to 4.80 or beyond." \par \par \uc2  JOANNE FONG, economist at PhilleoAllied Securities in Kuala Lumpur \par \par \uc2  "I don't think it will have much effect. There are some valid points that have been made. I agree that the weakened ringgit will damage the economy, and I personally feel it is too low. And I believe they will continue with the flexible exchange rate policy. \par \par \uc2  "They certainly have not announced anything unexpected or concrete. It was more to try to reassure people." \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926du17017sw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
