\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia Ringgit Hits New Low Late On Speculative Dlr Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 1998\par 10:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (Dow Jones)--The Malaysian ringgit hit a new historical low of MYR 4.0600 against the dollar in late Asian trading Monday on what dealers believe was speculative buying of the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Negara, tried to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the decline but to no avail. \par \par \uc2  Around 0908 GMT (4:08 a.m. EST), the dollar was quoted at MYR 4.0550, up from MYR 3.9730 ringgit late Friday, trading between MYR 3.9650 and MYR 4.0600 during the day. \par \par \uc2  'This is definitely speculative buying. I don't think it is commercial-driven,' said a Singapore-based trader. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the sharp decline in the ringgit wasn't an isolated case as other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , such as the Indonesian rupiah, have also weakened Monday. \par \par \uc2  They said with the weakening of other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it was difficult for the ringgit to maintain its levels against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  They said some market participants are taking their positions for the new year and they are still positive on the dollar. \par \par \uc2  'It is potentially the profitable thing to do,' said the Singapore-based dealer, referring to the dollar-buying activity Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated Bank Negara spent $50 to $70 million to support the ringgit Monday. \par \par \uc2  As reported Monday, Malaysia's Deputy Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim, who is also the finance minister, said Bank Negara should retain its right to defend the ringgit from further slides in value. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 05-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0922GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 1851 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du15002z5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
