\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Bank Negara reserves fall after  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Azhar Sukri \par \uc2 539 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1997\par 11:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR, July 22 (Reuter) - Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell by 12.5 percent in the fortnight to July 15, confirming market estimates of the size of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the ringgit. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced on Tuesday that its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , gold and other reserves fell to 61.9 billion ringgit as at July 15, 1997, compared to 70.71 billion ringgit a fortnight earlier. \par \par \uc2  Bank Negara is estimated to have spent over $2.0 billion in defending the ringgit in the last few weeks against speculators who have been selling down all \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Southeast Asia. \par \par \uc2  "This just proves what the market has been believing. In U.S. dollar terms two to three billion is what they (Bank Negara) have spent in the last few weeks, from mid-May to second week of July," said Daniel Lian, regional economist with NatWest Markets in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The pressure on the ringgit increased over the last two weeks after Thailand allowed the baht to float and the Philippines widened the peso's trading band, both effectively devaluing their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On July 8, Bank Negara struck heavily against speculators, selling between $1 billion to $2 billion to prop up the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  After an initial defence, Bank Negara since last week has allowed the ringgit to fall against the dollar. The Malaysian unit fell to a 38-month low of 2.6450 to a dollar on Friday, or over 5.5 percent lower than the 2.5050 level two weeks ago. \par \par \uc2  At 0900 GMT on Tuesday, the ringgit was at 2.6225/45 to a dollar. \par \par \uc2  Economists said the fall in reserves will not have any impact on the economy as Malaysia's reserves were more than adequate to provide it a comfortable import cover. \par \par \uc2  "It is not a shocking number. It will not have very much impact on the economy," said Lian. \par \par \uc2  "Normally a decline in reserves means a decline in money supply. That can be offset by more generous injections of liquidity into the system," he said. \par \par \uc2  With the decline of nearly nine billion ringgit ($3.46 billion) in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, "it (the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) could not have gone on for too long," said Eddie Lee, chief economist at Vickers Ballas in Singapore. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves as at July 15, 1996 amounted to 66.68 billion ringgit, showing a fall of 4.78 billion ringgit on a year-on-year basis. \par \par \uc2  Total assets stood at 96.82 billion ringgit on July 15 against 100.99 billion ringgit on June 30, but were slightly higher than 95.72 billion ringgit a year ago. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in circulation stood at 22.07 billion ringgit, compared to 21.95 billion ringgit in June. \par \par \uc2  "It actually does not mean the country is any poorer, if the ringgit recovers, they (Bank Negara) could recoup the losses," said Lian. \par \par \uc2  Economists said they applauded Bank Negara's policy of not defending the ringgit further. \par \par \uc2  "In the past week Bank Negara has let the ringgit float more freely. Already they have chosen the wiser path," said Lee at Vickers Ballas. \par \par \uc2  -- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7m027wf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
