\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Fall Further; Malaysia Ringgit Focus \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 1997\par 07:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets saw further turmoil Monday, with most regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  plunging against the U.S. dollar in a continued reaction to the decisions to allow freer trading in the Thai baht, Philippine peso and Indonesian rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Although late-morning trading has seen some consolidation after the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was said by traders to be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to check the ringgit's fall against the dollar, many market participants are certain the dollar will continue to strengthen against local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The region-wide sell-off gained momentum after Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in an apparent change of policy, failed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold the dollar below 2.5250 ringgit, the level it has defended vigorously against speculators in the past few weeks. \par \par \uc2  As the dollar surged by 1.8% against the ringgit to a morning's high of 2.5500 ringgit, the Indonesian rupiah, the Thai baht and the Singapore dollar all registered heavy falls against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'With regional central banks saying one thing and doing another - plunging into a round of competitive devaluations - the market can see no reason to be long these \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  right now,' says the head of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at one U.S. investment bank. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0505GMT \par \par \uc2  1134 4201 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7e053dj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
