\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2 /Klibor -2: Rise Linked To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 : Analysts \b0\par\par\uc2 300 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 1997\par 05:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-Dow Jones)-- \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's benchmark three-month Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates rose Wednesday, and economists said it was linked to the suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Tuesday to protect the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  'The rise in the Klibor is a side part of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a fixed-income analayst based in Hong Kong, referring to the widely held belief that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold over US$1 billion dollars late Tuesday and in overseas trading to keep the ringgit from weakening. \par \par \uc2  Several analysts and dealers said the higher Klibor level, and the suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank Negara, seemed to be partly over \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears of possible spillover to the ringgit from the recent rumors of devaluation surrounding the Philippine peso. \par \par \uc2  At the late-morning fixing, the one-month Klibor were at 8.00%, up from 7.76% Tuesday. The three-month Klibor were at 7.94%, up from 7.74%, while the six-month Klibor were at 7.81%, up from 7.74%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers note that the rise over the past few days in the Klibor started soon after last week's decision by the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to move toward a 'managed float' for its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But economists remain divided as to how long the higher rates will last, and most said it was a short-term reaction with the rates likely to come down over the next week or 10 days. \par \par \uc2  The fixed-income analyst from Hong Kong also didn't expect the Klibor highs to 'last too long,' but he said much now would depend on what happened with the Philippine peso, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's concerns over any knock-on effect to the ringgit. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0357GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt79051my\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
