\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia Ringgit Higher Vs U.S. Dollar In Late Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 1997\par 10:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-Dow Jones)--The Malaysian ringgit was higher against the U.S. dollar in late trading Thursday, boosted by various factors, including a sharp rise in interbank rates. \par \par \uc2  Dealers and economists said Bank Negara had pushed up the rates to levels not seen since February 1993, to draw players to the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and keep it from weakening further. \par \par \uc2  The ringgit weakened significantly Wednesday in what dealers said was a 'spillover effect' from the problems surrounding the Thai baht. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they widely believed \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday at around the 2.5248-ringgit level, to stop the dollar strengthening above this level. \par \par \uc2  And many said that Malaysia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had raised all three main Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates Thursday, to support Wednesday's rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and make the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  more attractive for investors. \par \par \uc2  Around 0750 GMT (03:50 a.m. EDT), the dollar was at 2.5065 ringgit, down from 2.5245 ringgit late Wednesday and 2.5177 ringgit early Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the money market, at the late morning fixing, the one-month Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates were at 7.59%, up sharply from 7.30% Wednesday. The three-month Klibor jumped to 7.60% from 7.36%, while the six-month Klibor also increased to 7.60% from 7.40% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded in a wide range between 2.5025 ringgit and 2.5215 ringgit during the day. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0803GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5f03etm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
