\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2  Ringgit/Early -2:Rumors Of Bank Negara  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 April 1997\par 06:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The dollar has traded between 2.5092 ringgit and 2.5121 ringgit so far this morning. But overnight the dollar was trading at the 2.5137-ringgit level. \par \par \uc2  It had come off that level, dealers said, because someone - believed to be Bank Negara Malaysia - was selling just enough dollars and buying ringgit. That selling was keeping the dollar from moving much beyond its current trading level. \par \par \uc2  'Somebody is selling up there,' the Singapore-based dealer said. 'Rumors are it's Negara, but we haven't really seen its name.' \par \par \uc2  A second ringgit dealer, this one in Kuala Lumpur, said he was confident the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy ringgit with dollars at the 2.5120-ringgit and 2.5125-ringgit levels. That would strengthen the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and push the dollar lower. \par \par \uc2  'We can be fairly sure it's Negara,' the dealer said. 'They were there.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on such rumors. \par \par \uc2  If the rumors are true, this would confirm suspicions last week that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  preferred a strong ringgit. Dealers said then that Bank Negara had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the ringgit's recent depreciation against the dollar, buying dollars between 2.5110 ringgit and 2.5120 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  In the money market Wednesday, Bank Negara didn't officially \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . At the late-morning fixing, the one-month Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates were at 7.39%, up from 7.31% Tuesday. The three-month Klibor were at 7.40%, up from 7.37%. The six-month Klibor were at 7.42%, up from 7.39%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-04-97 \par \par \uc2  0403GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 1851 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4g02op1\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (malaysia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clve